{
  "_about": "The Enhanced Rich vegetation per chapter (src/Mech3/VegetationSidecar.cs, docs/architecture/Mech3.md). 'kinds' lists the decoration models that are vegetation, by the model name templates.zrd uses; every model not listed keeps the original's stamp. A kind's values are per-stamp spreads, each 0 when absent: jitter_uv (texture repeats per UV axis, 0..0.5), yaw_deg (0..180; a card shows no turn, so a stamp mirrors its card with probability yaw_deg/180), tint (per colour channel, 0..0.5), brightness (0..0.5). 'seed' salts the variation's fixed stream; 'mask' is the brush mask beside this file; 'sets' name lists of listed kinds and 'picks' give a ground texture a set. Under the Original setting nothing reads this file. The vegetation lab writes one chapter's entry here when run from the source tree.",
